{
  "id": "alg7-c4-s2-n40",
  "card_id": "alg7-c4-s2-n40",
  "chapter": null,
  "section": null,
  "number": "40",
  "title": "从根号下面提出因式. 把因式移到根号下面",
  "printed_title": "40. 从根号下面提出因式. 把因式移到根号下面",
  "start_page": 242,
  "start_printed": 236,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 14,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "假设需要比较$\\sqrt{50}$和$4\\sqrt{2}$的大小. 可以用不同的方法解这个题.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 236,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0242#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1. 我们把根式$\\sqrt{50}$变形：$\\sqrt{50}=\\sqrt{25\\times2}=\\sqrt{25}\\times\\sqrt{2}=5\\sqrt{2}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 236,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0242#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "很明显，$5\\sqrt{2}>4\\sqrt{2}$. 因此$\\sqrt{50}>4\\sqrt{2}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 236,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0242#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2. 把积$4\\sqrt{2}$写成平方根的形式. 为此用16的平方根代替正因数4. 那么$4\\sqrt{2}=\\sqrt{16}\\times\\sqrt{2}=\\sqrt{32}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 236,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0242#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在容易比较$\\sqrt{50}$和$\\sqrt{32}$的大小. 因为$50>32$，所以$\\sqrt{50}>\\sqrt{32}$（因为函数$y=\\sqrt{x}$是增函数）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 236,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0242#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此，$\\sqrt{50}>4\\sqrt{2}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 236,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0242#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "当用第一种方法解题时，我们用5和$\\sqrt{2}$的积代替$\\sqrt{50}$.这时就说，从根号下面提出了因数5.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 236,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0242#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "当用第二种方法解题时，我们用32的平方根代替$4\\sqrt{2}$.这时就说，把因数4移到了根号下面.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 236,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0242#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们来看其他的例子.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 236,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0242#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例1　从$\\sqrt{9a^7}$的根号下面提出因式.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 236,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0242#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "当$a\\geq0$时，根式$\\sqrt{9a^7}$是有意义的. 把被开方式$9a^7$写成两个因式的积,其中一个因子恒等于一个单项式的平方:$9a^7=9a^6\\times a=(3a^3)^2\\times a$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 236,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0242#13",
        "p0243#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "那么,根据非负的因式的积的平方根的定理,得:$\\sqrt{9a^7}=\\sqrt{(3a^3)^2a}=\\sqrt{(3a^3)^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{a}=|3a^3|\\cdot\\sqrt{a}=3a^3\\sqrt{a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 237,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0243#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 2 在$-4\\sqrt{3}$的表示式里,把因数移到根号下面.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 237,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0243#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$-4\\sqrt{3}$的值是负的. 因此不能把$-4\\sqrt{3}$写成算术平方根. 但是这个式子可以变形为:$-4\\sqrt{3}=-1\\times4\\sqrt{3}=-1\\times\\sqrt{16}\\times\\sqrt{3}=-\\sqrt{48}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 237,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0243#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把正因数$4$移到根号下面以后,我们把$-4\\sqrt{3}$写成了和算术平方根相反的表示式.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 237,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0243#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 3 在$a\\sqrt{2}$的表示式里,把因数移到根号下面.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 237,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0243#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在式$a\\sqrt{2}$里,因数$a$可以是非负数,也可以是负数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 237,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0243#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果$a\\geq0$, 那么$a\\sqrt{2}=\\sqrt{a^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=\\sqrt{2a^2}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 237,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0243#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果$a<0$, 那么$-a>0$, $a\\sqrt{2}=-(-a)\\sqrt{2}=\\sqrt{(-a)^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{a^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{2a^2}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 237,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0243#9"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
